tunities to Prevent Violence Act of 2025 or the STOP Violence Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill allows funds under the Edward Byrne Memorial Justice Assistance Grant Program to be used to assist public assembly facilities in preparing for and protecting against mass violence. A <em>public assembly facility</em>&nbsp;means a structure or facility, place, or activity where concentrations of people gather for purposes such as deliberation, education, worship, shopping, employment, entertainment, recreation, sporting events, or similar activities.</p>","updateDate":"2026-10-01T18:51:06Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"STOP Violence Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-10-01T18:51:52Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-10-01T18:51:52Z"}
